  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commit to Grow Equality Initiative. Commit to Grow Equality is a global process to enhance gender equality and women&#x2019;s empowerment in agrifood systems through financing and partnerships. Bringing together governments, philanthropy, the private sector, United Nations and other multilateral agencies, civil society organizations and others, the process aims to unite key stakeholders to commit investments and partnerships to make agrifood systems work better for women, and transform them in the process.</narrative>
